note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Retain the incumbent 64-row shape and admit one paired-scale 32-row shape.
note Smaller or wider shapes remain unqualified and refused.
fn native_qgshape rt ulong warps ulong to ulong
if and eq rt 4 eq warps 8
ret 1
end
if and eq rt 2 eq warps 4
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
